<title>USA: Bruno's Inc FY96 shr loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Bruno's Inc FY96 shr loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, Ala. 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr	 loss  $2.03	   loss   $3.03</p>
<p> EBITDA	    148,081		  82,952</p>
<p> Net	 loss  51,189	  loss   75,837</p>
<p> Sales	     2,899,044		2,891,076</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  n/a			n/a</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Net loss for the 1997 fifty-three weeks include unusual items of $88.6 million associated with the company's divestiture program. Net loss for 1996 includes unusual items of $130.3 million. The company's divested 47 stores in its fourth quarter and in December 1996 acquired Seessel Holdings Inc, a ten store supermarket chain in Memphis, Tennesseee.</p>
<p>Due to the adoption of a new fiscal year, results for the fifty-three week period are compared to the unaudited fifty-two week period ended January 27, 1996.</p>
